# Rediseno de Proyectos, aviso de empezar una tarea: la notificacion de «Escribir el capitulo 3» (bloquea)
# sale con Empezar y En 10 min; Empezar abre Focus con la sesion de la tarea.
# Needs the seeded app and the debug broadcast fired BEFORE this walk (no START: force-stopping the app
# would remove the notification):
#   python .claude/scripts/seed_progress_db.py --device
#   adb shell am broadcast -f 32 -n io.github.thaguille.bbettercalendar/com.example.bbettercalendar.notifications.task.TaskStartReceiver --ez debug_first_eligible true
# Run: python bbadb.py run-steps .claude/skills/adb-ui-test/steps/rp-task-start.steps --save rp-task-start
WAIT 3000
SWIPE 540 15 540 1700 700
WAIT 2000
SHOT rp-task-start-shade
TAP text=Start|Empezar
WAIT 5000
SHOT rp-task-start-disclosure
# The task blocks and the AVD has no accessibility service: Focus starts unarmed and shows the existing
# explanation once (decision d3). Back closes it and leaves Focus on screen.
KEY KEYCODE_BACK
WAIT 2000
ASSERT id=focusRingBox
SHOT rp-task-start-focus
